        "body": {
          "en-US": {
            "nodeType": "document",
            "data": {},
            "content": [
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Showcasing the driving dynamics that are fast becoming a Toyota trademark, the ",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "uri": "https://www.buyatoyota.com/socal/"
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "nodeType": "text",
                        "value": "Southern California Toyota dealers",
                        "marks": [],
                        "data": {}
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": " recently hosted a three-day Thrill Ride Event, featuring the new Corolla Hatchback, during the annual LA Auto Show.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Chick Hearn Court at LA Live was converted into a mini-race track where professional stunt drivers treated passersby to an intense 45-second run as the Hatch slalomed its way through evasive maneuvers, hairpin turns and hair-raising 360 donuts.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Eleven So-Cal-based influencers (with a combined following of 2.6 MM) were on hand to experience the event first-hand, including actor and singer Logan Henderson, Tory Belleci from Mythbusters and Danielle Lombard from the Bachelor.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "The adrenaline-fueled action and all the WOWs and OMG reactions were captured on camera and will be featured in a series of TV commercials for the SCTDA beginning in January.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
